<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Dear <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Insert
Principal Name]</span>, <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">I’m writing to invite <span style="background:yellow;
mso-highlight:yellow">[School Name</span>] to partner with the American Red
Cross through our Future Blood Donor program. This educational program is
comprised of two elements. The first element is a 10-minute educational
presentation that teaches students about the function of blood in their body
and the lifesaving blood donation process. The second element is a blood drive
held outside of school hours and supported by a parent volunteer group or PTO.
Through this program, your students will have the opportunity to take action
and show leadership by recruiting adults to donate blood and be recognized for
their efforts.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">I noticed on your website that <span style="background:
yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[School Name/School District]</span>’s mission is
to <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[insert school’s
mission statement or value-added statement]</span>. Our Future Blood Donor
program can help you accomplish this mission while engaging students, parents
and members of your community. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">I will be in your area on <span style="background:yellow;
mso-highlight:yellow">[date]</span> and <span style="background:yellow;
mso-highlight:yellow">[date]</span> and would like to share and discuss the
opportunity for your school to participate in this educational blood program. I
would need 15 minutes of your time and am happy to meet at a time that is
convenient for you, including before or after school. If you have any
questions, please feel free to contact me. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Kind Regards,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Email Signature
Here]<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""></span></p>]]></td>
